[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1167","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1167.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1243","title":"Dansie Shopping Cart 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Dansie Shopping Cart 3.04 及更早版本存在隐私泄露漏洞，购物车程序会将用户敏感凭据（如登录账号密码）自动发送至开发者控制的电子邮箱地址，属于后门型隐私窃取缺陷。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N），仅通过正常访问受影响购物车页面即可触发数据外泄，导致用户机密性严重受损（C:P/I:N/A:N），CVSS 评分 5.0（中危）。该漏洞影响所有部署 Dansie Shopping Cart 3.04 或更早版本的电商站点，用户注册、登录、下单等操作均会导致凭据被开发者窃取。建议立即升级至官方修复版本或更换购物车系统，并强制重置所有用户密码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1243"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:27Z","remediation":"立即停用 Dansie Shopping Cart 3.04 及所有早期版本，迁移到现代安全支付网关系统或支持安全更新的电子商务平台。如无法立即迁移，可立即禁用购物车扩展功能并移除敏感信息自动发送配置，以防止用户凭证泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0051.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0066.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0071.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0086.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/470457/100/0/threaded","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1243.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1243.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1243","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1243.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1243.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/52862ce9daccf736821f20dad3f82fea401e5f1e/2000/CVE-2000-1243.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1243.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1243.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1243.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2000-1243.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1167.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1166","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1166.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1240","title":"AnyPortal PHP 远程信息泄露漏洞","description":"AnyPortal(php) 系统中的 siteman.php3 脚本存在未明确漏洞，版本在 2000 年 4 月 22 日之前受影响。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过未知攻击向量向该系统发送特制请求，触发信息泄露漏洞，导致系统绝对路径等敏感信息被泄露。该漏洞影响部署有 AnyPortal(php) 的 Web 服务器，攻击条件简单，仅需远程网络访问即可利用，且无需身份认证。攻击者可通过路径泄露进一步了解服务器目录结构，为后续攻击提供便利。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1240"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:26Z","remediation":"升级 AnyPortal PHP 至 2000 年 4 月 22 日或之后的版本（已修复 siteman.php3 路径泄露）。若无法升级，建议在 Web 服务器层面限制对 siteman.php3 的访问（如 Apache 使用 <Files \"siteman.php3\"> Require all denied </Files>），并配置 PHP 关闭 display_errors 避免错误回显绝对路径。同时部署 WAF 规则拦截针对该文件的异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/23983","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/25441","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1240.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1240.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1240","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1240.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1240.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1240.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ed0864e87bec515a12f89ab060c3cbb0a6a56af5/2000/CVE-2000-1240.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1240.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1240.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1240.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1166.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1166.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1165","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1165.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1238","title":"BEA Systems WebLogic Server 访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"BEA Systems WebLogic Express 和 WebLogic Server 5.1 SP1 至 SP6 版本存在访问控制绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于服务器对 URL 路径未进行充分规范化处理，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在受限 JSP 页面或 Servlet 资源的 URL 中插入多个连续正斜杠（//）字符，绕过访问控制机制直接访问受保护的资源页面。该漏洞影响运行 WebLogic 5.1 SP1-SP6 的所有实例，攻击者无需凭据即可在无需任何交互的情况下远程利用，成功利用后可获取受限页面的敏感信息或执行未授权操作，CVSS v3 评分为 7.5（HIGH），危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1238"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:26Z","remediation":"建议将 WebLogic Server 5.1 SP1-SP6 或 WebLogic Express 5.1 SP1-SP6 升级至 WebLogic Server 5.1 SP7 或 WebLogic Express 5.1 SP7。升级前请先从 BEA 官方 FTP (ftp://ftpna.bea.com/pub/releases/patches/SecurityBEA00-0600.zip) 下载安全补丁 SecurityBEA00-0600 并按 BEA 官方文档完成安装。如暂无法升级，可在 WebLogic 前端 Web 服务器（如 Apache/IIS）的 URL 重写规则中配置将包含多个连续正斜杠的请求统一标准化为单个斜杠，或通过防火墙限制对受保护 JSP/servlet 路径的间接访问，以临时缓解漏洞利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5089","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5588","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/52138c35bcb0784b4efb0e41fb1e599736d809a9/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1238.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1238","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1238.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1238.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/343a9c8af3f97395548d45562cf85cc26422f7cd/2000/CVE-2000-1238.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1238.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1238.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1238.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1238.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1238.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1165.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1165.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1164","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1164.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1237","title":"FTGate POP3 服务器用户名枚举漏洞","description":"FTGate 邮件服务器的 POP3 服务存在用户枚举漏洞。当远程攻击者向 POP3 端口发送带有无效用户名的 USER 请求时，服务器会返回 -ERR 错误响应码，而发送有效用户名时则返回不同响应，攻击者可利用响应差异来判断哪些用户名在系统中是有效的。该漏洞影响使用 FTGate 作为邮件服务器的组织，攻击者无需身份认证即可在网络可达的条件下远程枚举有效账户，进而对已识别的账号实施暴力密码猜测攻击，最终可能导致邮件账户被非法入侵、敏感邮件数据泄露。由于该漏洞可通过网络远程利用且无需任何凭证，在 2000 年左右的互联网环境下，配备自动化脚本的攻击者可大规模枚举并破解大量邮件账户，对组织内部通信安全和用户隐私构成直接威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1237"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:26Z","remediation":"建议升级 FTGate 邮件服务器至最新版本（若厂商仍提供更新），或迁移至现代邮件服务器软件。若无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制 POP3 端口(110/995)仅允许受信 IP 访问，同时启用账户锁定策略（如 5 次失败锁定 30 分钟）并强制使用强密码，部署.fail2ban 等工具监控并自动封禁暴力破解 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0282.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/4793.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1237.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1237.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1237","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1237.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1237.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1237.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1237.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1237.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1237.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/3c4d7392fa5965a157cd052f4789036ef0f7ddd6/api/2000/CVE-2000-1237.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1164.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1163","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1163.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1236","title":"Oracle Internet Application Server mod_sql SQL注入漏洞","description":"Oracle Internet Application Server（IAS）3.0.7 及更早版本中的 mod_sql 组件存在 SQL 注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在 URL 查询字符串中嵌入恶意 SQL 语句，向后台数据库提交任意 SQL 命令。由于该组件将用户输入直接拼接进 SQL 查询而未做任何过滤或参数化处理，攻击者可借此绕过应用程序逻辑，直接操纵数据库。该漏洞影响运行 Oracle IAS 的 Web 服务器，攻击者可利用其读取、修改或删除数据库中的敏感信息，严重时可能导致整个数据库被接管。此漏洞利用条件宽松，攻击者仅需向目标发送包含恶意查询参数的 HTTP 请求即可触发，无需任何身份凭据，攻击复杂度低，潜在危害大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1236"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:26Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Oracle Internet Application Server 10g Release 2 (10.2) 或更高版本，该版本修复了 mod_sql SQL 注入漏洞。升级前，请执行以下配置变更：1）在 httpd.conf 中禁用未验证的URL解析，2）配置mod_security模块以过滤恶意SQL语句，3）使用Oracle数据库自带的PL/SQL绑定参数机制替代动态SQL拼接。如无法立即升级，可临时通过防火墙规则阻止对 IAS服务器的直接SQL查询访问，并将默认监听端口从80/8080更改为非标准端口以降低暴露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0339.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0372.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0463.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/155881","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5817.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2150","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1236.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1236.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1236","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1236.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-1236.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1236.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1236.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1236.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fb434b2032246212419d81952c5a487d58bc8ffa/2000/CVE-2000-1236.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1236.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1163.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1162","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1162.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1235","title":"Oracle Internet Application Server 未授权信息泄露漏洞","description":"标签中输出。<value>Oracle Internet Application Server (IAS) 3.0.7 及更早版本中，端口监听器（port listener）和 modplsql 模块的默认配置存在安全缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求，访问 Database Access Descriptor (DAD) 文件，从而获取特权数据库信息，造成敏感数据泄露。该漏洞利用门槛低，攻击者无需凭据即可在网络可达条件下发起攻击。受影响版本包括 Oracle IAS 3.0.7 及之前所有版本，CVSS 向量显示该漏洞主要影响系统保密性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1235"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:26Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Oracle Internet Application Server 到 3.0.8 或更高版本以获取安全补丁，或修改 DAD 文件配置中认证和权限控制项，将数据库访问权限限制为特定用户并禁用匿名访问；如无法立即升级，可通过防火墙封锁对 modplsql 端口的直接HTTP访问，并在应用服务器中添加 IP地址白名单以限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0339.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0372.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0463.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/155881","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5818.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2150","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1235.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1235","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1235.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1235.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1235.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/881dc8aad9cc7f4353e5388bbdaaeb83a2e3abe3/2000/CVE-2000-1235.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1235.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1235.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1235.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2000-1235.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1162.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1161","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1161.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1233","title":"Phorum 3.0.7 SQL注入漏洞","description":"Phorum 3.0.7 版本的 read.php3 及其他脚本存在 SQL 注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含恶意 SQL 语句的 sSQL 参数，构造特制 HTTP 请求触发漏洞，从而在数据库层面执行任意 SQL 查询。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本的 Phorum 论坛系统，攻击者借此可窃取敏感数据、篡改或删除数据库内容，甚至在某些条件下获取数据库服务器的控制权限。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者仅需网络可达即可利用，无需任何认证凭据。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1233"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:26Z","remediation":"立即将 Phorum 升级至 3.0.7 之后的安全版本，并对所有包含 sSQL 参数的脚本（如 read.php3）实施输入过滤：在 PHP 代码中对 sSQL 参数添加 mysql_real_escape_string() 转义，禁止直接拼接用户输入到 SQL 查询语句中；如暂无法升级，可在 Apache/Nginx 配置中添加 rewrite 规则拦截包含 \"sSQL\" 参数的恶意请求，同时限制数据库账号权限为只读以降低被拖库风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2000/01/msg00215.html","http://hispahack.ccc.de/mi020.html","http://www.digitalsec.net/stuff/z-mirrors/hispahack/mi020.htm","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1233.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1233.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1233.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1233","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-1233.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1233.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1233.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1233.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1233.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/49d534031f059b5baeabd1b01333339621c7c95a/2000/CVE-2000-1233.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1161.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1160","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1160.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1232","title":"Phorum upgrade.php3 数据库篡改漏洞","description":"Phorum 3.0.7 的 upgrade.php3 脚本存在未授权访问漏洞，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过该脚本直接修改 Phorum 论坛数据库中的特定数据表。该漏洞位于论坛升级功能页面，攻击者无需任何账号凭据即可利用。由于升级脚本未对访问请求进行身份验证且缺乏输入校验机制，攻击者只需向目标站点发送特制请求即可篡改数据库内容，从而破坏论坛数据的完整性和一致性。该漏洞影响所有使用 Phorum 3.0.7 版本的站点，CVSS 评分为 5.0，攻击复杂度低，可完全远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1232"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:25Z","remediation":"立即删除或限制 upgrade.php3 文件的访问权限（例如通过 .htaccess 仅允许本地 IP 访问，或直接删除该文件），并升级 Phorum 至 3.0.8 或更高版本。由于 Phorum 已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在维护的论坛软件（如 phpBB、FluxBB 或 Discourse）。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙或 Web 服务器层面对 /upgrade.php3 实施访问控制，仅允许管理员 IP 访问，并检查数据库是否存在异常数据变更。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2000/01/msg00215.html","http://hispahack.ccc.de/mi020.html","http://www.digitalsec.net/stuff/z-mirrors/hispahack/mi020.htm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1232.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1232.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1232","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1232.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1232.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1232.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d343bea8cfc0d9952499ddc0950571762ca42cd/2000/CVE-2000-1232.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1232.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1232.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1232.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1160.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1159","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1159.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1231","title":"Phorum 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Phorum 3.0.7 的 code.php3 脚本存在文件读取漏洞。该脚本在处理 HTTP 请求的 query string 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤和验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含路径遍历序列的恶意查询字符串，读取 phorum 目录下的任意敏感文件内容。漏洞利用条件宽松，攻击者无需任何凭证即可在远程直接发起攻击，利用复杂度低（CVSS 向量 AV:N/AC:L/Au:N）。该漏洞影响 Phorum 3.0.7 版本，主要威胁系统文件 confidentiality，不会影响数据完整性和服务可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1231"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:25Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Phorum 到 3.1 或更高版本（官方已修复此文件读取漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，请在 Web 服务器配置中禁止直接访问 code.php3，或在代码层面对 query string 参数实施严格的路径遍历过滤（如过滤 ../ 等序列），同时设置 open_basedir 限制 PHP 只能访问 phorum 目录外的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2000/01/msg00215.html","http://hispahack.ccc.de/mi020.html","http://www.digitalsec.net/stuff/z-mirrors/hispahack/mi020.htm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1231.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1231.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1231","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1231.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1231.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1231.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f633ee26df31c8f5776009de314413a57041bf98/2000/CVE-2000-1231.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1231.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1231.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1231.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1159.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1158","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1158.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1229","title":"Phorum 3.0.7 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Phorum 3.0.7 论坛系统的主设置管理功能中存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者在获取 Phorum 管理员权限后，可在 Master Settings 页面的默认 .langfile 名称字段中插入\"..\"（点点）序列进行路径遍历，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，被读取的文件内容会直接显示在 admin.php3 页面中。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的 langfile 文件名进行充分的路径过滤和校验，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，成功利用后可读取系统敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd、数据库配置文件等），导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1229"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:25Z","remediation":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2000-12290\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2000-1229\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"Phorum 3.0.7 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞\"\ndescription = \"Phorum 3.0.7 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程管理员可在 Master Settings 管理功能的默认 .langfile 名称字段中使用\\\"..\\\"（点点）序列读取任意文件，导致文件内容在 admin.php3 中显示。攻击者无需认证即可通过网络利用此漏洞获取服务器敏感信息，如配置文件、密码文件等。\"\nseverity = \"MEDIUM\"\nscore = 5.0\nsources = [\"cve\"]\npublished = \"2000-12-31\"\nupdated = \"2000-12-31\"\nremediation = \"升级到 Phorum 最新版本或对 .langfile 字段输入进行严格过滤，移除\\\"..\\\"等目录遍历序列，限制文件读取路径范围。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2000/01/msg00215.html\", \"http://hispahack.ccc.de/mi020.html\", \"http://www.digitalsec.net/stuff/z-mirrors/hispahack/mi020.htm\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = []\nexp_urls = []\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z\"\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2000/01/msg00215.html","http://hispahack.ccc.de/mi020.html","http://www.digitalsec.net/stuff/z-mirrors/hispahack/mi020.htm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1229.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1229.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1229","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1229.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1229.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1229.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81a148a05078ecaf8ff30dafcb6a9851540b3434/2000/CVE-2000-1229.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1229.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1229.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1229.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1158.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1158.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1158.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1157","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1157.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1227","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0/2000 SMB 协议拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 的 SMB 协议实现存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标主机连续发送多个 SMBnegprots 协商请求但不读取响应数据，导致服务器缓冲区积压、连接资源耗尽，使合法用户无法建立新的网络连接。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 系统，攻击者仅需在网络层面即可发起利用，无需任何凭据或用户交互，成功率极高。Microsoft 已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞，建议受影响系统升级至最新安全更新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1227"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:25Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Windows 2000 Service Pack 4 (SP4)，该SP4修复了与SMBnegprots请求相关的处理缺陷。如果目标系统是 Windows NT 4.0，则应升级到 NT 4.0 Service Pack 7 或更高版本。如无法立即应用SP4，可通过修改注册表（禁用SMB协议的异常处理）作为临时缓解措施。升级后重新引导系统以确保修复生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/63322","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1301","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1227.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1227","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1227.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1227.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1227.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1227.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1227.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f15ca12380fc765fd5195387509666c3b113208/2000/CVE-2000-1227.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1227.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1227.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1157.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1156","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1156.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1226","title":"Snort Snort 1.6 ASCII Packet 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Snort 1.6在启用纯ASCII数据包记录模式或IDS模式下选择解码后的ASCII数据包记录时，远程攻击者可通过发送Snort无法识别的非IP协议数据包（如nmap协议扫描）导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需任何认证即可通过网络远程触发，影响Snort 1.6版本的正常运行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1226"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:25Z","remediation":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2000-01226\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2000-1226\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"Snort 1.6 ASCII数据包记录模式拒绝服务漏洞\"\ndescription = \"Snort 1.6在启用纯ASCII数据包记录模式或IDS模式下选择解码后的ASCII数据包记录时，远程攻击者可通过发送Snort无法识别的非IP协议数据包（如nmap协议扫描）导致服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需认证，通过网络即可远程触发，影响服务可用性。\"\nseverity = \"MEDIUM\"\nscore = 5.0\nsources = [\"cve\", \"nvd\"]\npublished = \"2000-12-31\"\nupdated = \"2000-12-31\"\nremediation = \"升级至Snort 2.0及以上版本，该版本修复了非IP协议处理异常导致崩溃的问题。如无法升级，应避免在生产环境中使用ASCII数据包记录模式，或配置防火墙过滤非IP协议流量作为临时缓解措施。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-1226\", \"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2000-1226\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = []\nexp_urls = []\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z\"","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0122.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0126.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1226.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1226.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1226","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1226.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1226.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1226.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f15ca12380fc765fd5195387509666c3b113208/2000/CVE-2000-1226.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1226.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c6e457224984003aac7610b750677033fb679879/tracker/CVE/2000/CVE-2000-1226.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1226.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1156.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1155","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1155.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1225","title":"Xitami testcgi.exe 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Xitami 2.5b Web 服务器在安装时默认将 testcgi.exe 程序放置在 cgi-bin 目录下，远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过网络直接访问该 CGI 程序，从而获取 Web 服务器的敏感配置信息（如系统路径、目录结构、环境变量等）。该漏洞影响 Xitami 2.5b 版本，攻击复杂度低，危害中等，可能导致进一步的信息收集和渗透攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1225"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:25Z","remediation":"删除 Xitami 安装目录下 cgi-bin 中的 testcgi.exe 文件，或将其重命名为非可执行扩展名。如使用 Xitami 2.5c 或更高版本，请升级至最新版。在 Web 服务器前端配置访问控制规则，限制对 cgi-bin 目录的匿名访问，仅允许受信任 IP 范围访问该目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0109.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1225.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1225.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1225","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1225.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1225.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1225.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c79f038b13e1b688fc233f22ffcfe21236e6044/2000/CVE-2000-1225.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1225.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1225.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/f785f3444159263c9afde232b5456d1f01686673/api/2000/CVE-2000-1225.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1155.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0851","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0851.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1244","title":"Computer Associates InoculateIT Exchange 服务器病毒防护绕过漏洞","description":"Computer Associates InoculateIT Agent for Microsoft Exchange Server 存在邮件病毒防护绕过漏洞。该代理在扫描邮件附件时，若 SMTP 邮件头中缺少\"From\"字段，则无法正确识别附件中的病毒内容，导致病毒防护机制被完全绕过。攻击者作为未经身份认证的远程攻击者，可通过发送缺少发件人字段的特制恶意邮件，携带病毒或恶意代码附件绕过服务器端杀毒软件的检测，从而感染内部用户并传播至整个邮件系统。该漏洞影响 InoculateIT 4.53 与 Microsoft Exchange Server 的集成部署环境，CVSS v2 评分为 7.5，危害等级高，可造成保密性、完整性和可用性的部分损失。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1244"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:27Z","remediation":"立即将 InoculateIT Agent for Microsoft Exchange 升级到 Computer Associates（现 Broadcom）发布的修复版本，可联系 Broadcom 技术支持获取适用于 InoculateIT 4.53 的安全补丁包。如短期内无法升级，应在邮件网关层面实施 SMTP 头字段强制校验策略，拒绝或剥离缺少 \"From\" 字段的入站邮件，同时确保病毒特征库持续更新，并考虑在 Exchange 传输代理层增加额外邮件内容扫描规则作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0158.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20401","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1244.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1244.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1244","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1244.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1244.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1244.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/52862ce9daccf736821f20dad3f82fea401e5f1e/2000/CVE-2000-1244.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1244.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1244.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1244.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0851.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0850","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0850.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1234","title":"Phorum 3.0.7 邮件中继漏洞","description":"Phorum 3.0.7 论坛软件的 violation.php3 脚本存在任意邮件中继漏洞，该脚本未对用户提交的 Mod 和 ForumName 参数进行严格过滤和验证，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制 HTTP 请求，向任意电子邮件地址发送邮件并滥用 Phorum 服务器作为垃圾邮件转发代理。该漏洞影响所有部署 Phorum 3.0.7 版本的站点，攻击者无需登录凭据即可在网络可达条件下发起利用，从而大规模发送钓鱼邮件或垃圾邮件，严重损害邮件服务信誉并增加被邮件服务商封锁的风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1234"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:26Z","remediation":"立即将 Phorum 升级到最新稳定版本以修复 violation.php3 的邮件中继漏洞。如暂时无法升级，请删除服务器上的 violation.php3 文件，或在 Apache 配置中添加 RewriteRule ^/violation\\.php3 - [F,L] 禁止外部访问该文件，并在 Nginx 配置中使用 location = /violation.php3 { deny all; } 拒绝访问，同时在 MTA 层面限制 Web 服务器发送邮件的权限以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2000/01/msg00215.html","http://hispahack.ccc.de/mi020.html","http://www.digitalsec.net/stuff/z-mirrors/hispahack/mi020.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2272","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20587","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1234.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1234.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1234.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1234.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1234.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1234","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-1234.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1234.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1234.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1234.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0850.toml"}]